@startuml keyboard
!include _theme.puml

title The keyboard, remapped

component "Your keyboard\n(built-in or external)" as kbd #F5F5F2
component "kanata\nhome-row mods · navigation layer · chords" as kanata #EAF3F8
component "The application\nyou are typing in" as app

kbd --> kanata : every key press
kanata --> app : remapped keys

note bottom of app
  kanata sits between the keyboard and
  everything else, so the same remapping
  works in every application without each
  one needing to know about it.
end note
@enduml
